    planned spending is below your minimum from year 1", want plain "Below
    target"`. Package result: FAIL budget2/internal/handlers/whatif.
(c) guardrail_optimizer.html:181 `{{if eq $cut "100.00"}}` -> `"99.99"`:
    KILLED by TestGuardrailOptimizerWorstAnnualCutSaturationExplained
    (guardrail_plan_floor_test.go:352) -> three failures, incl.
    `"Alternative not-saturated": cut cell explanation present = true, want
